      "type": "question",
      "text": "Claude Codeで複数リポジトリの指示やスキルを使う際、どんな衝突を確かめますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-01.mp3",
      "audioHash": "26f1af3d8105c4ab9a1c66cfb6c793acac59553cef7483dc4bc46b35d7ada427",
