    {
      "index": 2,
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Strands harnessを業務アプリに組み込む前に、既定構成の何を点検しますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-02.mp3",
      "audioHash": "87f694d1772bd6376d7eb1bbab7cb7d0db025a4a5c8801099f82f32a70618003",
